            explanation: "Ranikhet disease is a regional name for Newcastle disease. It is not the same as H5N1 avian influenza, which is listed separately. Biology p. 165 supplies this disease-name pairing and the adjacent influenza subtype association.", sectionId: "poultry-breeds-and-diseases", source: { document: "biology", page: 165 }, cognitive: "recall"
